# CODEOWNERS — shared / enterprise-adjacent surface
#
# GitHub requires an approving review from a listed owner before a PR that
# touches these paths can merge. The point is NOT to slow contributors down on
# the community edition — it is to keep the proprietary `sigrift-sentinel`
# overlay reusable. Sentinel imports these seams in-process (see the plugin
# points in src/sigrift/bridge and src/sigrift/providers), so changes here
# need an owner's review to keep that reuse working.
#
# Everything not matched below has no owner and follows normal review rules.
#
# The supply-chain / deployment section at the end has a second purpose:
# those files decide what runs with release and registry
# privileges (workflows, root-run installers, image builds), so a change
# to them always needs an owner's review.

# --- Rust gateway core: shared proxy/ingest/scoring surface -----------------
/src/gateway/crates/sigrift-gateway-core/   @SigRift/maintainers

# --- Python plugin seams that sentinel imports at runtime -------------------
# Bridge modules with `from sigrift_sentinel import ...` (optional imports):
/src/sigrift/bridge/app.py                      @SigRift/maintainers
/src/sigrift/bridge/routers/signature_library.py @SigRift/maintainers

# Provider plugin contract sentinel registers against (TDOA, fingerprint, …):
/src/sigrift/providers/base.py      @SigRift/maintainers
/src/sigrift/providers/registry.py  @SigRift/maintainers

# Discovery points for the crypto / DSP plugins sentinel ships:
/src/sigrift/lib/crypto/__init__.py @SigRift/maintainers
/src/sigrift/lib/dsp/__init__.py    @SigRift/maintainers

# --- Licensing / legal source of truth --------------------------------------
/LICENSE        @SigRift/maintainers
/NOTICE         @SigRift/maintainers
/LEGAL.md       @SigRift/maintainers
/CODEOWNERS     @SigRift/maintainers

# --- CI/CD, installers, images ---------------------------------------------
# Workflows run with contents/packages/id-token write; scripts/ holds the
# root-run installers.
/.github/                       @SigRift/maintainers
/scripts/                       @SigRift/maintainers
/docker-compose*.yml            @SigRift/maintainers
/.dockerignore                  @SigRift/maintainers
/src/gateway/Dockerfile         @SigRift/maintainers
/src/sigrift/bridge/Dockerfile  @SigRift/maintainers
/src/sigrift/edge/Dockerfile    @SigRift/maintainers
